"entity": {
"name": "Happen, Inc.",
"description": "Happen, Inc. is a U.S. digital marketplace bank focused on the Motivated Middle high FICO, high-income borrowers actively managing their financial lives. The firm\u2019s success is fueled by advanced credit underwriting, a proprietary technology platform, and a marketplace bank model that generates compelling revenue through loan sales, net interest income, and fee-based services. It operates through the LendingClub Bank and LendingClub Corporation (Parent Only) segments. The LendingClub Bank segment is involved in the provision of a full complement of financial products and solutions, loans, leases, and deposits. The LendingClub Corporation (Parent Only) segment includes the holding company legal entity. The company was founded by Renaud Laplanche and Soulaiman Htite on October 2, 2006 and is headquartered in San Francisco, CA.",
